        "name": "USN-8758-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that dracut did not properly shell-quote messages written by the die() function to the emergency hook directory. An attacker on the adjacent network controlling a rogue DHCP server could use this issue to inject commands that execute as root during boot-failure handling. (CVE-2026-15816)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-15816"
        ]
      },
